{
  "info": {
    "name": "FiadoCheck — SCRUM-110 Scoring y ML (SCO-01 a SCO-10)",
    "description": "Colección ejecutable del bloque §4.4 del plan de pruebas (responsable: Eliel).\n\nCUBRE: SCO-01, SCO-02, SCO-03, SCO-04, SCO-05, SCO-08, SCO-09a, SCO-09c, SCO-10.\n\nNO CUBRE (no son peticiones HTTP, se ejecutan aparte):\n  SCO-06  atomicidad de syncMLPrediction  -> consulta SQL\n  SCO-07  ML caído degrada sin crash      -> apagar predict.py desde la terminal\n  SCO-09b modelo.pkl ausente              -> renombrar el archivo\n  SCO-11  ML_SERVICE_URL                  -> variable de entorno\n\nREQUISITOS ANTES DE CORRER\n  Backend en {{baseUrl}} (Local o Azure)\n  Microservicio ML en {{mlUrl}} (Local: http://localhost:8000 · Azure: https://fiadocheck-ml.azurewebsites.net)\n\nCREDENCIALES\n  tendero1@tiendasegura.com / FiadoTest2026 (id_tendero = 6).\n\n  IMPORTANTE: NO usar soto@fiado.com. Esa cuenta tiene fila en la tabla tenderos\n  pero su usuario está con id_rol = 2 (cliente), así que el login emite el JWT con\n  id_tendero = null y TODOS los endpoints de scoring devuelven 404 Cliente no\n  encontrado. Existe un script fixSotoAsCliente.js que la convirtió a cliente.\n\nDATOS FIJOS VERIFICADOS EN BASE DE DATOS\n  Cliente 6            -> 2 créditos con el tendero 6, nivel medio (SCO-01/03/05/08)\n  Cliente 1            -> pertenece al tendero 1, NO vinculado al 6 (sirve para SCO-04)\n  Cliente 56           -> existe pero no tiene fila en scoring (sirve para SCO-09c)\n  Cliente nuevo        -> lo crea y vincula la propia colección (sirve para SCO-02)\n\nRE-EJECUTABLE: el cliente nuevo se crea con cédula por timestamp. Limpieza:\n  DELETE FROM usuario WHERE email LIKE '%@test.fiadocheck.com';",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "mlUrl", "value": "https://fiadocheck-ml.azurewebsites.net" },
    { "key": "tenderoEmail", "value": "tendero1@tiendasegura.com" },
    { "key": "tenderoPassword", "value": "FiadoTest2026" },
    { "key": "clienteConHistorial", "value": "6" },
    { "key": "clienteAjeno", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "clienteSinScoring", "value": "56" },
    { "key": "clienteNuevo", "value": "" },
    { "key": "clienteNuevoPassword", "value": "FiadoTest2026" },
    { "key": "tokenTendero", "value": "" },
    { "key": "fechaCalculo1", "value": "" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 — Setup: login del tendero con cartera",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Setup — login correcto', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "const body = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('Setup — es un tendero con id_tendero', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(body.tendero).to.not.be.null;",
              "});",
              "if (body.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('tokenTendero', body.token); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{tenderoEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{tenderoPassword}}\"\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "02 — Setup: registrar cliente nuevo (sin créditos)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "prerequest",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "const ts = (Date.now() % 900000000 + 100000000).toString();",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('clienteNuevo', ts);"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Setup — cliente registrado en auth', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
              "});",
              "console.log('Cliente nuevo (sin créditos):', pm.collectionVariables.get('clienteNuevo'));"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"nombre_completo\": \"Cliente Scoring {{clienteNuevo}}\",\n  \"email\": \"scoring.{{clienteNuevo}}@test.fiadocheck.com\",\n  \"telefono\": \"3001112233\",\n  \"cedula\": \"{{clienteNuevo}}\",\n  \"direccion\": \"Calle Prueba 45\",\n  \"password\": \"{{clienteNuevoPassword}}\"\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/registerClientes", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "registerClientes"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "02b — Setup: asociar cliente al tendero",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('Setup — cliente asociado al tendero', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenTendero}}" }
        ],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"id_cliente\": \"{{clienteNuevo}}\"\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/clientes/asociar", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["clientes", "asociar"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "03 — SCO-05b: GET scoring de cliente sin calcular → 404",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('SCO-05 — cliente vinculado pero sin scoring calculado devuelve 404', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-05 — el error indica que hay que calcular primero', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.include('No existe scoring');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenTendero}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/scoring/{{clienteNuevo}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["scoring", "{{clienteNuevo}}"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "04 — SCO-02: calcular scoring de cliente sin créditos",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('SCO-02 — responde 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "const b = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('SCO-02 — puntaje conceptual 50', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(b.puntaje_total).to.eql(50);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-02 — nivel medio y límite 50.000', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(b.nivel_riesgo).to.eql('medio');",
              "    pm.expect(Number(b.limite_sugerido)).to.eql(50000);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-02 — NO se invoca al Random Forest: confianza null', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(b.confianza).to.be.null;",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-02 — desglose en ceros (comportamiento esperado, no inconsistencia)', function () {",
              "    const d = b.desglose;",
              "    pm.expect(d.puntualidad + d.cumplimiento + d.historial + d.antiguedad).to.eql(0);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenTendero}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/scoring/{{clienteNuevo}}/calcular", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["scoring", "{{clienteNuevo}}", "calcular"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "05 — SCO-01 y SCO-08: calcular scoring de cliente con historial",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('SCO-01 — responde 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "const b = pm.response.json();",
              "const d = b.desglose;",
              "",
              "pm.test('SCO-01 — devuelve las 4 variables del desglose', function () {",
              "    ['puntualidad', 'cumplimiento', 'historial', 'antiguedad'].forEach(function (k) {",
              "        pm.expect(d, 'falta ' + k).to.have.property(k);",
              "    });",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-01 — cada variable está entre 0 y 25', function () {",
              "    Object.values(d).forEach(function (v) {",
              "        pm.expect(v).to.be.at.least(0);",
              "        pm.expect(v).to.be.at.most(25);",
              "    });",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-01 — puntaje_total es exactamente la suma de las 4 variables', function () {",
              "    const suma = d.puntualidad + d.cumplimiento + d.historial + d.antiguedad;",
              "    pm.expect(b.puntaje_total).to.eql(suma);",
              "});",
              "",
              "pm.test('SCO-08 — limite_sugerido dentro del rango [0, 300000]', function () {",
              "    const lim = Number(b.limite_sugerido);",
              "    pm.expect(lim).to.be.at.least(0);",
              "    pm.expect(lim).to.be.at.most(300000);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-08 — nivel_riesgo es uno de los tres válidos', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(b.nivel_riesgo).to.be.oneOf(['bajo', 'medio', 'alto']);",
              "});",
              "",
              "console.log('SCO-01 desglose:', JSON.stringify(d), '| puntaje:', b.puntaje_total);",
              "console.log('SCO-08 nivel:', b.nivel_riesgo, '| limite:', b.limite_sugerido, '| confianza:', b.confianza);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenTendero}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/scoring/{{clienteConHistorial}}/calcular", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["scoring", "{{clienteConHistorial}}", "calcular"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "06 — SCO-05: GET scoring persistido (captura fecha_calculo)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('SCO-05 — devuelve el scoring persistido', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "const b = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('SCO-05 — trae los campos esperados', function () {",
              "    ['puntaje_total', 'nivel_riesgo', 'limite_sugerido', 'fecha_calculo', 'desglose'].forEach(function (k) {",
              "        pm.expect(b, 'falta ' + k).to.have.property(k);",
              "    });",
              "});",
              "pm.collectionVariables.set('fechaCalculo1', b.fecha_calculo);",
              "console.log('fecha_calculo antes del recálculo:', b.fecha_calculo);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenTendero}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/scoring/{{clienteConHistorial}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["scoring", "{{clienteConHistorial}}"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "07 — SCO-03: recalcular scoring existente",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('SCO-03 — el recálculo responde 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenTendero}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/scoring/{{clienteConHistorial}}/calcular", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["scoring", "{{clienteConHistorial}}", "calcular"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "08 — SCO-03: verificar upsert (no duplica, refresca fecha)",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('SCO-03 — sigue devolviendo un único scoring', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "const b = pm.response.json();",
              "const antes = pm.collectionVariables.get('fechaCalculo1');",
              "pm.test('SCO-03 — fecha_calculo se refrescó (upsert, no insert duplicado)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(new Date(b.fecha_calculo).getTime()).to.be.at.least(new Date(antes).getTime());",
              "});",
              "console.log('fecha_calculo después:', b.fecha_calculo, '| antes:', antes);"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenTendero}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/scoring/{{clienteConHistorial}}", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["scoring", "{{clienteConHistorial}}"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "09 — SCO-04: cliente de otro tendero → 404",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('SCO-04 — cliente no vinculado a este tendero devuelve 404', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-04 — no revela datos del cliente ajeno', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.include('Cliente no encontrado');",
              "});"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{tokenTendero}}" }],
        "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/scoring/{{clienteAjeno}}/calcular", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["scoring", "{{clienteAjeno}}", "calcular"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "10 — SCO-09a: POST /predict del microservicio ML",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('SCO-09a — el microservicio responde 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "const b = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('SCO-09a — no devuelve error (el modelo está entrenado)', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(b.error, b.error).to.be.undefined;",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-09a — nivel_riesgo es una de las tres clases', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(b.nivel_riesgo).to.be.oneOf(['bajo', 'medio', 'alto']);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-09a — confianza es una probabilidad entre 0 y 1', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(b.confianza).to.be.at.least(0);",
              "    pm.expect(b.confianza).to.be.at.most(1);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-09a — devuelve limite_sugerido y puntaje_rf', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(b).to.have.property('limite_sugerido');",
              "    pm.expect(b).to.have.property('puntaje_rf');",
              "});",
              "console.log('SCO-09a — predicción:', JSON.stringify(b));",
              "console.log('Latencia /predict:', pm.response.responseTime, 'ms (referencia para SCRUM-112)');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"id_cliente\": {{clienteConHistorial}}\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{mlUrl}}/predict", "host": ["{{mlUrl}}"], "path": ["predict"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "11 — SCO-09c: /predict de cliente sin scoring → error con HTTP 200",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('SCO-09c — CONTRATO REAL: responde HTTP 200, no 4xx', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "pm.test('SCO-09c — el detalle viene en el campo error del cuerpo', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(pm.response.json().error).to.include('No se encontraron datos de scoring');",
              "});",
              "console.log('SCO-09c — Node convierte esto en excepción y degrada al scoring por reglas.');"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"id_cliente\": {{clienteSinScoring}}\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{mlUrl}}/predict", "host": ["{{mlUrl}}"], "path": ["predict"] }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "12 — SCO-10: POST /ml/retrain",
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('SCO-10 — el endpoint de reentrenamiento responde 200', function () {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});",
              "const b = pm.response.json();",
              "pm.test('SCO-10 — status es skipped o training, ambos válidos', function () {",
              "    pm.expect(b.status).to.be.oneOf(['skipped', 'training']);",
              "});",
              "",
              "if (b.status === 'skipped') {",
              "    pm.test('SCO-10 — skipped por umbral del 20%: comportamiento CORRECTO, no fallo', function () {",
              "        pm.expect(b.message).to.include('20%');",
              "    });",
              "    console.log('SCO-10 — omitido. current_count:', b.current_count, '| last_train_count:', b.last_train_count);",
              "    console.log('Para ejercitar el reentrenamiento real hacen falta', Math.ceil(b.last_train_count * 1.2), 'filas de scoring.');",
              "} else {",
              "    console.log('SCO-10 — reentrenamiento lanzado en background. Revisa la terminal de predict.py:');",
              "    console.log('debe aparecer: [ML] Modelo reentrenado y swapped correctamente.');",
              "}"
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"evento\": \"prueba_manual_SCO10\"\n}" },
        "url": { "raw": "{{mlUrl}}/ml/retrain", "host": ["{{mlUrl}}"], "path": ["ml", "retrain"] }
      }
    }
  ]
}
